OL,3,GNEWSAE-bike long-term loan scheme set
OL,4,Afor 2027 launch
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommuters in South Yorkshire are set to
OL,7,Fbe able to hire e-bikes on a long-term
OL,8,Floan under a new scheme aimed at giving
OL,9,Fpeople more travel choices.
OL,11,FSouth Yorkshire Mayoral Combined
OL,12,FAuthority (SYMCA) has announced plans
OL,13,Ffor an initial 275 e-bikes to be
OL,14,Fleased.
OL,16,FThe scheme would run alongside other
OL,17,Fschemes across the region, including
OL,18,Fplans to make almost 1,000 e-bikes
OL,19,Favailable for short-term hire in
OL,20,FSheffield.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
