OL,3,GNEWSAE-bike long-term loan scheme set
OL,4,Afor 2027 launch
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe region's mayor, Oliver Coppard,
OL,7,Fsaid: "I'm proud to say we're the first
OL,8,Fplace in the country to develop this
OL,9,Ftype of scheme."
